Day 3.Was there anything about the event that could be improved
logistically? Break times, post test time, lunch times, offsite events
etc?YesPlease provide details:Shuttle needed for Thursday dinner
evening.Are there any issues or changes in the content that we need to
make/be aware of?NoWere there any successes (WOW moments) that stood
out?YesPlease provide details:This class was extremely supportive of one
another and engaged since Day 1. Watching Jose deliver his Capstone
Presentation was a highlight for the week. He utilizes SMART, DISC, SPARK
and SWOT to demonstrate his understanding and ability to apply it.Were
there any PAX details that stood out for future surprise and delight
moments?NoDId you have any challenging events, PAX or situations that we
need to be aware of?NoDo you have any other feedback or suggestions to
improve future training sessions?Not at this time.
